msgid ""
"The sidebar chooses the set the table shows. The search field narrows that "
"set."
msgstr ""
"De zijbalk kiest de set die de tabel toont. Het zoekveld verkleint die set."

#: kxbps-qt/qml/views/SettingsView.qml:148
